  m_text: 'You''ve made a way out. This is the end.


    In this brief journey,
    you''ve shown the awareness to succeed. When the answer was not clear, you did
    not turn away, but instead went pushed and perservered.


    Well done. Now
    off you go. Skedaddle.'
